{"name":"Chantilly","hex":"#edb8c7","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Chantilly","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A city in Oise department, Hauts-de-France, France, formerly in Picardy.","An unincorporated community in Lincoln County, Missouri, United States."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A medium-sized, longhair domestic cat breed, originating in Canada and the United States.","Ellipsis of Chantilly cream."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Chantilly"}],"entries":[{"title":"Chantilly, Oise","blocks":[{"text":"Chantilly is a commune in the Oise department in the Valley of the Nonette in the Hauts-de-France region of Northern France. Surrounded by Chantilly Forest, the town of 10,591 inhabitants (2023) falls within the metropolitan area of Paris. It lies 38.4 km (23.9 mi) north-northeast of the centre of Paris and together with six neighbouring communes forms an urban area of 37,039 inhabitants (2022)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Ch%C3%A2teau_de_Chantilly%2C_the_palace.JPG/330px-Ch%C3%A2teau_de_Chantilly%2C_the_palace.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chantilly%2C_Oise","wikidata":"Q126675"},{"title":"US Chantilly","blocks":[{"text":"Union Sportive de Chantilly is a football club from Chantilly, Oise, France. It was founded in 1902 and, as of the 2020–21 season, plays in the Championnat National 3, the fifth tier of French football. The club won promotion from the sixth tier at the first attempt, after previously being relegated from the Championnat National 3 in 2019."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/52/US_Chantilly_logo.svg/330px-US_Chantilly_logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/US_Chantilly","wikidata":"Q3550541"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/common